OL,3,AMicrosoft profits soar days after
OL,4,Aannouncing thousands of layoffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FTechnology giant Microsoft says its
OL,7,Fprofits for the three months to the end
OL,8,Fof September jumped to more than
OL,9,F$36.6bn (#27.5bn), just days after
OL,10,Fannouncing plans to cut its workforce
OL,11,Fby more than a quarter.
OL,13,FOn Monday, the Windows developer said
OL,14,Fit would offer buyouts to around 60,000
OL,15,Fof its workers to cut costs as it pours
OL,16,Fbillions of dollars into artificial
OL,17,Fintelligence (AI).
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
