OL,3,ADeath of US actress Hayden Panettiere
OL,4,Aruled accidental, ending local police
OL,5,Aprobe
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death of US actress Hayden
OL,8,FPanettiere has been ruled accidental,
OL,9,Fending a local probe into her death,
OL,10,Fpolice in South Carolina have said.
OL,12,FThe Heroes and Nashville star died in
OL,13,FAugust from the toxic effects of
OL,14,Ffentanyl, Xanax and several other drugs
OL,15,Fin her system, at the age of 36.
OL,17,FCiting the medical examiner's report
OL,18,Flast month that found Panettiere died
OL,19,Ffrom a drug overdose, the Greenville
OL,20,FPolice Department said it had
OL,21,F"concluded its investigation" into her
OL,22,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
