OL,3,ADeath of US actress Hayden Panettiere
OL,4,Aruled accidental, ending local police
OL,5,Aprobe
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Drug Enforcement Agency (DEA)
OL,8,Freportedly joined a local police probe.
OL,9,FIt is unclear if that investigation has
OL,10,Falso concluded. The BBC has contacted
OL,11,Fthe DEA for comment.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
